{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1664,
    "dDurationMs": 5925,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Hayya Alal Salat. Hayya Alal Salat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9125,
    "dDurationMs": 5455,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hayya Alal Falah. Hayya Alal Falah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15689,
    "dDurationMs": 4986,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allahu Akbar. Allahu Akbar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21699,
    "dDurationMs": 5455,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: La Elaha Ella Allah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33327,
    "dDurationMs": 1416,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: Alhamdu Lillah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35340,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alhamdu Lillahi Lazzi Hadana Bil Iman Wa Al-Islam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39473,
    "dDurationMs": 3237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah Wahdahu La Shareeka Lah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42923,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wa Ashhadu Anna Muhammadan Abduhu Wa Rasuluh\n(This was later removed from the Shahaadah)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45776,
    "dDurationMs": 5456,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(3:102) ٱتَّقُوا ٱللَّهَ حَقَّ تُقَاتِهِ وَلَا تَمُوتُنَّ إِلَّا وَأَنتُم مُّسْلِمُونَ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52512,
    "dDurationMs": 7043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm afraid that this Khutba is going to, to be, it would be longer than you thought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60000,
    "dDurationMs": 9123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll try to be very fast. So, I beg of you, your attention and concentration. And I have to go very fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70445,
    "dDurationMs": 11555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Khutba, at least the first part, will deal with the methodology or technique in understanding better or understanding the Quran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82000,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or how to get more out of the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86341,
    "dDurationMs": 7952,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second Khutba will be dedicated to just one example to illustrate the pointers in the first Khutba."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96085,
    "dDurationMs": 4659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And let me just remind you about three quotations from the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101341,
    "dDurationMs": 5062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know this very well. Ustaz (teacher) has repeated and re-repeated it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107170,
    "dDurationMs": 1507,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, let me repeat it again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110597,
    "dDurationMs": 1161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111758,
    "dDurationMs": 4346,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[6:38]  ... We did not leave anything out of this scripture.** ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116104,
    "dDurationMs": 848,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or book."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118062,
    "dDurationMs": 1483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sura 6:38."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121545,
    "dDurationMs": 1062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember that, no?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122607,
    "dDurationMs": 1288,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123895,
    "dDurationMs": 7290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[6:114]  Shall I seek other than GOD as a source of law, when He revealed to you this book fully detailed?* ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132555,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[6:115]  The word ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133455,
    "dDurationMs": 1237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134692,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[6:115]  The word of your Lord is complete,* in truth and justice. ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139209,
    "dDurationMs": 1597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sura 6:115."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140806,
    "dDurationMs": 1749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "14 and 15."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142555,
    "dDurationMs": 2445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145000,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After saying that (unintelligible) and Allah had put the Quran together, after reciting it, we say it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151573,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, it is we who will explain it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155000,
    "dDurationMs": 976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's very clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156573,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah says He has not left anything out of this scripture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is complete, perfect, detailed, and He will explain it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After He revealed or after the recitation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170962,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These quotations clearly imply that the questions raised by the Quran,..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175133,
    "dDurationMs": 3294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see, the Quran raises questions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178427,
    "dDurationMs": 5170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or questions raised by Muslims,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183597,
    "dDurationMs": 4403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the answers of these will be found in the Quran itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188683,
    "dDurationMs": 806,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189489,
    "dDurationMs": 6753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we take these quotations the way Allah presents it to us, it means, if the Quran raises a question,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196242,
    "dDurationMs": 4758,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or if we raise a question, the answer must be found in the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202322,
    "dDurationMs": 1806,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope you agree with me on that point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204554,
    "dDurationMs": 2531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If not, then just listen to what I have to say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210555,
    "dDurationMs": 6360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we must not talk in the Quran for irrelevant or insignificant things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218451,
    "dDurationMs": 8549,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let us not go to Quran to find a recipe for chicken curry or Afghan pilaf, for example."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227725,
    "dDurationMs": 4365,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, certainly, if you know the Quran enough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232090,
    "dDurationMs": 5910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Quran tells us, do not serve poisoned curry to your friends or to your enemies. (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the contrary, if you're cooking curry and you have a hungry guest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242000,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you serve him, you feed him, feed the hungry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Quran, in many instances, says that men of understanding know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252000,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or will come to know the revelations of Allah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257000,
    "dDurationMs": 3469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, it seems that there is another way of knowing the Quran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260469,
    "dDurationMs": 1531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you have understanding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this is apparent, because when we ask the question,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who are men of understanding?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267384,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are the righteous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268384,
    "dDurationMs": 1616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, who are the righteous?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are the believers and they are those who study the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273469,
    "dDurationMs": 6702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, either Allah explains it to you directly and you will know the answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280171,
    "dDurationMs": 4256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or you have understanding, but the man of understanding is one who goes to Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284427,
    "dDurationMs": 3573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, in any case, the answer is indeed Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288000,
    "dDurationMs": 1171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope this is a,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289171,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is a logical technique."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291213,
    "dDurationMs": 3787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If A gives you B, and not A gives you B,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295000,
    "dDurationMs": 2787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since either A or not A in any case, it is B."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297787,
    "dDurationMs": 2213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, it's the Quran in any case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300573,
    "dDurationMs": 3214,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether Allah tells it to you directly or you use your understanding,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303787,
    "dDurationMs": 2019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's still to the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307299,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet, there are dangers or obstacles or warnings,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313299,
    "dDurationMs": 4981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which I think we should mention in trying to get explanations to our questions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318280,
    "dDurationMs": 4824,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or to get further elucidation to Quranic verses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324213,
    "dDurationMs": 1147,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first warning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326000,
    "dDurationMs": 1573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, this is just my opinion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327573,
    "dDurationMs": 1848,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's up to you to let people know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331000,
    "dDurationMs": 9934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First is too much emphasis on the Jewish Bible in making us understand the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342000,
    "dDurationMs": 1763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I said too much emphasis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346024,
    "dDurationMs": 2934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Bible, the Jewish Bible in particular,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348958,
    "dDurationMs": 4659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has been edited, re-edited, and re-re-edited,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353617,
    "dDurationMs": 5212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it has assumed its final form only 150 years before Christ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358829,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after the Babylonian captivity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362597,
    "dDurationMs": 6445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is after Ezra edited it, prescribes, re-edited it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369597,
    "dDurationMs": 4403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this is accepted by biblical scholars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375512,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Muslims must not have an inferiority complex"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381512,
    "dDurationMs": 3782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by depending so much on the Jewish scriptures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387597,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or, the other way around,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390597,
    "dDurationMs": 5403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Muslims should not be so proud that they know so much about the Jewish Bible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396000,
    "dDurationMs": 5469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because you will find out, if you read these Tafsirs (interpretations) of our ancestors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401469,
    "dDurationMs": 3555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anything that is difficult in the Quran to them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405024,
    "dDurationMs": 1763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they quote the Bible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406787,
    "dDurationMs": 3213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not so much to help us understand the Quran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410000,
    "dDurationMs": 3445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but to show that they know so much about the Jewish Bible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413445,
    "dDurationMs": 4256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in trying to show so much that they know about the Jewish Bible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417701,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they begin to forget their own Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419701,
    "dDurationMs": 2488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, this happens to reverent Muslims."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423341,
    "dDurationMs": 4976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a defect which many of us have, including your humble self."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428829,
    "dDurationMs": 1403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's showing off. I noticed that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430232,
    "dDurationMs": 1384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I fall into the trap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431616,
    "dDurationMs": 1787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I always want to show that I know the Bible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433403,
    "dDurationMs": 3208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least, to show that I didn't waste 12 years in a Catholic school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438787,
    "dDurationMs": 2683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we have to be, we have to check ourselves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441470,
    "dDurationMs": 2743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "check our pride that we know something about the Bible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444213,
    "dDurationMs": 4446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and at the same time, not to have this inferiority complex."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448659,
    "dDurationMs": 2768,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because in the first hundred years of Islam,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451427,
    "dDurationMs": 3573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when there were discussions with Christians in Syria and so on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455000,
    "dDurationMs": 3787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Muslims had to show that they also knew what the Christians knew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458787,
    "dDurationMs": 1848,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this is historical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462000,
    "dDurationMs": 5659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We must also consider that the Jewish Bible serves national purposes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467659,
    "dDurationMs": 2341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "genealogical purposes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470829,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's the meaning of the editing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474000,
    "dDurationMs": 4531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's always to show that the Jews are a distinct people, different from others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478531,
    "dDurationMs": 3725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this overemphasis that they are the chosen people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482256,
    "dDurationMs": 6336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "makes them, in their editing, emphasize more what is to their direct interest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489488,
    "dDurationMs": 12853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also, it's not at all safe to always explain the Quran through the Bible as we now have it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502341,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is a qualification."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505171,
    "dDurationMs": 4402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is nothing wrong in pointing out certain correspondences"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509573,
    "dDurationMs": 7640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between events or incidents or characters in the Quran and those in the Bible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517213,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is not just a matter of (unintelligible),"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519299,
    "dDurationMs": 3189,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it is a matter of developing our understanding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523171,
    "dDurationMs": 3171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Please do not misunderstand me, brothers and sisters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526342,
    "dDurationMs": 1957,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or sisters and brothers occasionally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528299,
    "dDurationMs": 1464,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know what's the protocol."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531000,
    "dDurationMs": 3384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not saying we should not consult the Jewish Bible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534384,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I say let us not overemphasise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536470,
    "dDurationMs": 3772,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the contrary, it is good to show certain correspondences"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540242,
    "dDurationMs": 4982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if, in the final analysis, it will help us understand the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546485,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As long as events are consistent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548485,
    "dDurationMs": 1515,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well and good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when there are discrepancies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the Quran must be the final one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555000,
    "dDurationMs": 3079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It must supersede the Bible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Other things in the Bible can be dismissed as irrelevant to the Quranic message,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "details about rituals, details about sacrifices,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the lives of their kings, their adulteries, their incest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571000,
    "dDurationMs": 2625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all of these things, this is all irrelevant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576000,
    "dDurationMs": 3115,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The great danger is to interpret, or understand the Quran"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579115,
    "dDurationMs": 3885,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "solely, exclusively in terms of the Bible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than letting the Quran explain itself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or letting Allah explain Himself in the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This, however, does not mean, as I said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595000,
    "dDurationMs": 2242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we must neglect the Bible entirely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597242,
    "dDurationMs": 2758,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the contrary, as I will try to show,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will be of some help in giving additional information."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604000,
    "dDurationMs": 3551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, as I will try to show, it is an information"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607551,
    "dDurationMs": 3449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can be reached back by the Quran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611000,
    "dDurationMs": 3242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and must be totally, be consistent with the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614242,
    "dDurationMs": 1758,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Needless to say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616000,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just (unintelligible) is consulting the Hadith"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620921,
    "dDurationMs": 1079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to explain the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622000,
    "dDurationMs": 2224,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is superfluous, huh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625388,
    "dDurationMs": 3758,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are people who use the Hadith to explain Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629146,
    "dDurationMs": 1612,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would like to give you examples of this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630758,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because some of them are very,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632758,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, are very comical, I would say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634758,
    "dDurationMs": 2612,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In any case, this must be avoided."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A criteria to guide us is that the Quran is flawless,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642000,
    "dDurationMs": 1418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "totally consistent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643418,
    "dDurationMs": 2903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as stated in the Sura 18, verse 1."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647339,
    "dDurationMs": 2418,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Quran also talks about Masallans,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649757,
    "dDurationMs": 2661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "examples, speaks of allegories,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652418,
    "dDurationMs": 2291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "similitudes, analogies, etc.,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654709,
    "dDurationMs": 2031,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together with direct verses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657709,
    "dDurationMs": 2582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, let me quote,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660291,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(unintelligible) of Allah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661291,
    "dDurationMs": 12819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[3:7]  He is the one who revealed this scripture to you, with perfect verses that must be taken literally—as constituting the essence of the scripture. Other verses are allegorical. ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675469,
    "dDurationMs": 1336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(3:7) مُتَشَٰبِهَٰتٌ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677914,
    "dDurationMs": 16632,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[3:7]  ... Those who harbor doubts in their hearts dwell on the allegorical verses to create confusion, and misrepresentation thereof. No one knows the correct interpretation thereof except GOD and those well founded in knowledge. ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694546,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those who listen to Allah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 696787,
    "dDurationMs": 1062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, it's very clear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some people avoid the clear verses of the Quran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or rather,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they concentrate on the allegories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to forget the clear verses of the Quran"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order to bring dissension and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717000,
    "dDurationMs": 1384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Allah does not tell us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718384,
    "dDurationMs": 3616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we should not try to study these allegories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722469,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We should try to understand these allegories of the Quran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725469,
    "dDurationMs": 2531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not use them to create dissension."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728810,
    "dDurationMs": 3493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the ideas here of these verses is that such allegories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732303,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "must not be interpreted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734213,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in an arbitrary manner"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736213,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so as to cause dissension"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738299,
    "dDurationMs": 3402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for religious or sectarian motives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742085,
    "dDurationMs": 1512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their interpretation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743597,
    "dDurationMs": 2787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "must be in terms of the Quranic verses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746384,
    "dDurationMs": 4256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a consistent or logical manner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751024,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752384,
    "dDurationMs": 12616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[11:1]  A. L. R. ... a scripture whose verses were perfectly designed, then elucidated.* ... from the One who is Wise, Cognizant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In brief,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766000,
    "dDurationMs": 2384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah Himself declares"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768384,
    "dDurationMs": 1616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that He explains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or elucidates His allegories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773500,
    "dDurationMs": 1403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the second Khutba,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774903,
    "dDurationMs": 1566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we will have one example"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776469,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to explain all of these things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778299,
    "dDurationMs": 1341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we have mentioned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779640,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "along theoretical lines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783541,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Astaghfirullah..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790427,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, this is one example"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792787,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for your elucidation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795787,
    "dDurationMs": 1213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or not elucidation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797000,
    "dDurationMs": 2213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for your edification. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799213,
    "dDurationMs": 1294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and entertainment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 802000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One subject only, to illustrate what we have discussed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805256,
    "dDurationMs": 4744,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem of the nakedness of Adam and Eve. Ok?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812654,
    "dDurationMs": 1341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813995,
    "dDurationMs": 2853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially we who live in the western world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816848,
    "dDurationMs": 1384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are inheritors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818232,
    "dDurationMs": 1128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or victims"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819360,
    "dDurationMs": 1555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of western culture,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820915,
    "dDurationMs": 1597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or western paintings,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822512,
    "dDurationMs": 1555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or western movies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824067,
    "dDurationMs": 1341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "TVs and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825787,
    "dDurationMs": 1213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do we always see?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827671,
    "dDurationMs": 3109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We always see Adam and Eve"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830780,
    "dDurationMs": 1793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depicted as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832573,
    "dDurationMs": 1806,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "physically naked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835019,
    "dDurationMs": 2555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even before the so-called (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839171,
    "dDurationMs": 6787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a movie, I saw a movie, that is (unintelligible). A young boy, a young girl, running."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845958,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, there are (unintelligible) around, because they are naked. Then, you see Michelangelo's painting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854256,
    "dDurationMs": 4417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Happy, a happy couple, young man and a young woman, naked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862256,
    "dDurationMs": 1824,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, that is now in our mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866511,
    "dDurationMs": 3489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Paradise was a kind of a new discovery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871280,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ok."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875171,
    "dDurationMs": 10744,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And from this, as well as our reading of the Bible, we begin to accept the second element,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885915,
    "dDurationMs": 6682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that because of this nakedness, they use fig leaves. Ok?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893536,
    "dDurationMs": 2909,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know why fig leaves. I have an answer for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897171,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But a little bit off-color, so I will not say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901171,
    "dDurationMs": 5402,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you look at the shape of the fig leaves, it's good enough to cover three aspects of a man's body."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907640,
    "dDurationMs": 919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910559,
    "dDurationMs": 3792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Bible specifically mentions fig leaves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914872,
    "dDurationMs": 5957,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Quran does not, huh? The Quran does not say that Adam and Eve"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920829,
    "dDurationMs": 2109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "covered themselves with fig leaves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922938,
    "dDurationMs": 5062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Quran only says, they covered themselves with leaves of the garden."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928810,
    "dDurationMs": 1398,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "More versatile."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932597,
    "dDurationMs": 7958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the Bible says that after the fall, when they covered themselves with fig leaves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940555,
    "dDurationMs": 4445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the good Lord taught them how to use skins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945000,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Very interesting. So, Allah, in the Jewish Bible, becomes a tailor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951000,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He tells Adam and Eve, no, fig leaves not good enough, skins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955573,
    "dDurationMs": 2526,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe, the garden was becoming colder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960701,
    "dDurationMs": 4635,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What does the Quran say? Okay, let's go slowly and carefully."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966659,
    "dDurationMs": 3678,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sura 20, verses 117, 118."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971616,
    "dDurationMs": 3573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I repeat. Sura 20:117-118."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975573,
    "dDurationMs": 2829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah warns Adam and Eve,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978402,
    "dDurationMs": 7598,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not to let Satan lead to their evictment from the garden,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986000,
    "dDurationMs": 1891,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to cause them misery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989000,
    "dDurationMs": 5787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For in the garden, Adam and Eve were guaranteed food,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994787,
    "dDurationMs": 4550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they were guaranteed that they will not go naked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001000,
    "dDurationMs": 8194,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What follows from this is that Adam and Eve in the garden were told not to worry about food and clothing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1009194,
    "dDurationMs": 3484,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things that they will have to worry when they are evicted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014000,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Allah says, and I quote the translation of Ustaz (teacher),"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018683,
    "dDurationMs": 6317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[20:118]  \"You are guaranteed that you will not hunger therein, nor go naked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025000,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Conclusion, logical conclusion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028000,
    "dDurationMs": 4294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adam and Eve were not naked in Paradise. Okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034427,
    "dDurationMs": 1062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's very clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037237,
    "dDurationMs": 867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 2,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040663,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Allah says in Sura 7:27,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044853,
    "dDurationMs": 13622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[7:27]  O children of Adam, let not the devil mislead you as he evicted your parents from Paradise, and removed their garments in order to show them their bodies. ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058475,
    "dDurationMs": 1525,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This Ustaz's (teacher) translation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060213,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Others instead of bodies say, expose their shame, their shameful parts, etc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065682,
    "dDurationMs": 3901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is something else. I'm gonna talk about that. That is for another good time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070000,
    "dDurationMs": 5607,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, what will Allah say that the devil will remove your garments if you were naked?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076332,
    "dDurationMs": 753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Huh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077981,
    "dDurationMs": 2275,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah says, the devil will remove your garment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080512,
    "dDurationMs": 4057,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you combine that with the first, it's very clear they have clothes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087512,
    "dDurationMs": 8365,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Sura 7, verse 27, Allah says very clear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095877,
    "dDurationMs": 4550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Adam and Eve had garments which Satan removed from them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100427,
    "dDurationMs": 2573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or caused to be removed from them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103427,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, this is a digression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106427,
    "dDurationMs": 7573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Translators, unduly influenced, by the Bible, put a parenthesis after robe or garment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114000,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they say, and Satan took away them, from them, the robes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1119000,
    "dDurationMs": 3213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They put parenthesis of innocence. (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122213,
    "dDurationMs": 1446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Quran never says of innocence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124000,
    "dDurationMs": 3062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just says, the devil took away the robes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128384,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But translators, because they're reading Bible, and they're still thinking of the Bible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132384,
    "dDurationMs": 2616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and with inferiority complex, they say, of innocence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the idea is that Adam and Eve were innocent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138683,
    "dDurationMs": 2275,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I don't think Adam and Eve were that innocent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140958,
    "dDurationMs": 2042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah had taught them the names,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1143000,
    "dDurationMs": 1659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which the angels did not know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144659,
    "dDurationMs": 1317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, they have knowledge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146403,
    "dDurationMs": 2597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are not a bunch of little kids trapped in nature."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149000,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're ignorant human beings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151469,
    "dDurationMs": 934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's more than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153469,
    "dDurationMs": 806,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155000,
    "dDurationMs": 6512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sura 7, again 22, and Sura 21:21 says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161512,
    "dDurationMs": 3488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that after they lost their robes or garments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165000,
    "dDurationMs": 4256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they began to cover themselves with leaves of the garden,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1169256,
    "dDurationMs": 1806,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaves from Paradise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172853,
    "dDurationMs": 3787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in 7, Sura 7:26,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176640,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's very beautiful,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179000,
    "dDurationMs": 5957,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah reveals to them a better garment or raiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184957,
    "dDurationMs": 2214,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ha, very beautiful, no?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1187171,
    "dDurationMs": 2829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, in Jewish Bible,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they were naked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192000,
    "dDurationMs": 1701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they put fig leaves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193701,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Allah says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194701,
    "dDurationMs": 1403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "skins are better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1196104,
    "dDurationMs": 768,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ok."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197214,
    "dDurationMs": 824,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199787,
    "dDurationMs": 1469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were clothed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201256,
    "dDurationMs": 2744,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they lost their clothes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204000,
    "dDurationMs": 3384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Adam and Eve made their own clothes on their own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207384,
    "dDurationMs": 1616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's very important, on their own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209427,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's since Allah taught them (unintelligible) on their own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212256,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Allah says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1213256,
    "dDurationMs": 3744,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[7:26]  O children of Adam, we have sent down to you ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1217000,
    "dDurationMs": 1384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or revealed to you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1218384,
    "dDurationMs": 2299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[7:26]  ... garments to cover your bodies, ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220683,
    "dDurationMs": 1317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or shame,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222341,
    "dDurationMs": 1256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[7:26]  ... as luxury. ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223597,
    "dDurationMs": 1062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is Ustaz's (teacher) translation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224659,
    "dDurationMs": 2597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another possibility instead of luxury,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227256,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to cover your body in a splendid or magnificent manner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232256,
    "dDurationMs": 2749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, I, I don't like the word, with all respect to Ustaz (teacher)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235768,
    "dDurationMs": 1725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I understand what he means by luxury."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237493,
    "dDurationMs": 1232,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's something luxurious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238725,
    "dDurationMs": 3749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it just happens that the word luxury these days has a bad connotation now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242768,
    "dDurationMs": 2171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, people are trying now to be more modest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244939,
    "dDurationMs": 1232,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nothing luxurious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247408,
    "dDurationMs": 3213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I understand what luxury means. I think it means,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250621,
    "dDurationMs": 1976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "splendid or magnificent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252597,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Allah says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253597,
    "dDurationMs": 3403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[7:26]  ... the garment of righteousness is the best. ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1257500,
    "dDurationMs": 2171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now again, translation from the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259671,
    "dDurationMs": 926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1260597,
    "dDurationMs": 4427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah did not like the leaves of Paradise,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265024,
    "dDurationMs": 976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gave them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266000,
    "dDurationMs": 1388,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "splendid garments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1267388,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1268388,
    "dDurationMs": 1048,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "however,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269436,
    "dDurationMs": 2952,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "better than the splendid garments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272388,
    "dDurationMs": 1854,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the garments of righteousness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1274242,
    "dDurationMs": 1419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, this is wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1276485,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's bad translation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278485,
    "dDurationMs": 2515,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I prefer Ustaz's translation, when he says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281000,
    "dDurationMs": 2291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[7:26]  ... the garment of righteousness is the best. ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283291,
    "dDurationMs": 2709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ustaz did not say that this is another garment, huh?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1286630,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually, I think,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288000,
    "dDurationMs": 1485,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the garment of righteousness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1289485,
    "dDurationMs": 2097,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the very garment which Allah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1291582,
    "dDurationMs": 1885,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gave to Adam and Eve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1293467,
    "dDurationMs": 3793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Something that is splendid and magnificent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297260,
    "dDurationMs": 1449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because the Arabic word is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1298709,
    "dDurationMs": 742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(7:26) وَ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1299451,
    "dDurationMs": 758,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300709,
    "dDurationMs": 2291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303000,
    "dDurationMs": 1242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Arabic translation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1304242,
    "dDurationMs": 4036,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and because they're influenced by the Jewish Bible, they say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308278,
    "dDurationMs": 929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1311000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the Jewish Bible, it says, there were with leaves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1314000,
    "dDurationMs": 1573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then Allah gives them skin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316000,
    "dDurationMs": 3261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, the Quran, Allah gives them splendid raiment, then they say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1319261,
    "dDurationMs": 1739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah gives them splendid raiment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1321000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1323000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "however,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1324000,
    "dDurationMs": 1768,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the garments of righteousness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1325768,
    "dDurationMs": 1104,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1326872,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, these are the garments of righteousness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329000,
    "dDurationMs": 1701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The splendid vestments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330701,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the garments of righteousness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1333511,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336000,
    "dDurationMs": 3602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah does not, did not bother with skins, and so and so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339602,
    "dDurationMs": 2706,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He just gave them a garment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1342308,
    "dDurationMs": 1692,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the garment of righteousness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344000,
    "dDurationMs": 829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344829,
    "dDurationMs": 1171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is almost saying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346000,
    "dDurationMs": 1341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "better than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347341,
    "dDurationMs": 2086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the fig leaves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349427,
    "dDurationMs": 1914,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are garments of righteousness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1351341,
    "dDurationMs": 1446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are luxurious,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352787,
    "dDurationMs": 1213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "magnificent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354000,
    "dDurationMs": 1573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or splendid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356000,
    "dDurationMs": 1725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, let's,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357725,
    "dDurationMs": 1853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to me, this is only one robe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359578,
    "dDurationMs": 4005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One robe is mentioned in Sura 7:26."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363583,
    "dDurationMs": 4858,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The garment of righteousness is the splendid, or luxurious one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368787,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Arabic is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369787,
    "dDurationMs": 616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(7:26) وَ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1370403,
    "dDurationMs": 701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371744,
    "dDurationMs": 1768,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't say, and something else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1374000,
    "dDurationMs": 1488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He could refer to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375488,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he is good and tall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379171,
    "dDurationMs": 2152,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not that he's good now, then he becomes tall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381323,
    "dDurationMs": 2061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He could be both, good and tall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383384,
    "dDurationMs": 1896,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But let me not go on to this logical aspect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386000,
    "dDurationMs": 1441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, let's go to the secret."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390341,
    "dDurationMs": 1659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adam and Eve"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are robed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1393000,
    "dDurationMs": 1701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their garments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395427,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 2,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396427,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they lost their robes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1399256,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 3,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400256,
    "dDurationMs": 1763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they made their own robes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403000,
    "dDurationMs": 829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 4,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403829,
    "dDurationMs": 1683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah teaches them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1405512,
    "dDurationMs": 1488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or reveals to them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407000,
    "dDurationMs": 1166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the best robes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410000,
    "dDurationMs": 1787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1411787,
    "dDurationMs": 1763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the problem of interpretation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414701,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hope Allah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415701,
    "dDurationMs": 1725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forgives me this (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1419213,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adam and Eve, I believe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421706,
    "dDurationMs": 1683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "originally wore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423389,
    "dDurationMs": 1611,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the garments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1425000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of complete"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1427000,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "obedience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429000,
    "dDurationMs": 2536,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were wearing the garments of obedience,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431536,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a natural state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433664,
    "dDurationMs": 2597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or as a natural condition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436261,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were just obeying because that is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438597,
    "dDurationMs": 2194,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how they were created, just to obey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1443000,
    "dDurationMs": 3303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as Sura 20, verse 21 says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446303,
    "dDurationMs": 2697,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adam disobeyed Allah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and thus, in 7:27,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452000,
    "dDurationMs": 1256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they lost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1453256,
    "dDurationMs": 1427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this robe of obedience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454683,
    "dDurationMs": 616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1455299,
    "dDurationMs": 1981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you wear the robe of obedience,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457280,
    "dDurationMs": 1256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you disobey,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458536,
    "dDurationMs": 1938,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you lost your robe of obedience, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1460474,
    "dDurationMs": 820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461294,
    "dDurationMs": 829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Quran says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462123,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adam took away from them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1465000,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their robes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466000,
    "dDurationMs": 1806,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they disobeyed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468787,
    "dDurationMs": 1469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 3,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1470256,
    "dDurationMs": 1128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "20:21,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471384,
    "dDurationMs": 4815,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adam and Eve clothes themselves on their own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1476839,
    "dDurationMs": 5242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not very effectively it seems, huh? Not very effectively because Allah said, this is not the right one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1482721,
    "dDurationMs": 1317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, it's very important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1484038,
    "dDurationMs": 4048,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is now why, man-made, huh, man-made, on his own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489792,
    "dDurationMs": 7119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Allah teaches them that the garments of righteousness, that is the best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497124,
    "dDurationMs": 3365,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And He teaches them how to, to wear it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501940,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this garment of righteousness is not the original garment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506329,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of obedience, but now being taught by Allah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1510000,
    "dDurationMs": 4815,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the consideration that mankind has now a free choice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1514815,
    "dDurationMs": 2555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to wear it or not to wear it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1517370,
    "dDurationMs": 3408,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words, it must be acquired by free will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521034,
    "dDurationMs": 3536,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first garment of obedience was just given"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524570,
    "dDurationMs": 3322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to Adam. He was not consulted. Adam do you want it or not?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528191,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was just given the garment of obedience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1530447,
    "dDurationMs": 2853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now the garments of righteousness, it's there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1533599,
    "dDurationMs": 2341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want it or you don't want it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1535940,
    "dDurationMs": 2213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The element of free will is there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540153,
    "dDurationMs": 3152,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's very interesting because precisely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1543305,
    "dDurationMs": 3152,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in 7:26, God says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1546457,
    "dDurationMs": 4218,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[7:26]  ... These are God's revelations to you, that you may take heed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1550675,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you may remember."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1553102,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And thus, I (unintelligible) with you that issue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1558002,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on (unintelligible) nakedness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1560002,
    "dDurationMs": 2725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's or she is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562727,
    "dDurationMs": 2555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(unintelligible) or (unintelligible) says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565282,
    "dDurationMs": 3194,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the story of Adam and Eve is something else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568476,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've not talked what does nakedness mean, huh, I did not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1572396,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is something else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574396,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not going to discuss their meaning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578060,
    "dDurationMs": 5541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All that I'm holding out here is that the issue of physical nudity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1583601,
    "dDurationMs": 4303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or physiological nakedness is not the main issue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1589226,
    "dDurationMs": 6778,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Physical nudity is just one instance, I'm not saying it's not important,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1596004,
    "dDurationMs": 4303,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm only saying that it is only one instance among many other things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1600307,
    "dDurationMs": 6522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that falls under the general category or issue of obedience and righteousness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607810,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allegory repeat again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1611218,
    "dDurationMs": 4346,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not denying that the element of decency is important here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1616161,
    "dDurationMs": 8057,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm only saying that the element of decency is only one aspect which falls under the general category of righteousness, alright?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1624986,
    "dDurationMs": 8527,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And therefore, this emphasis about the nakedness of Adam and Eve is not so important to me now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635049,
    "dDurationMs": 1531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not the main issue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1636751,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is an issue but not the main issue. "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639562,
    "dDurationMs": 2555,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What is an issue are really 3 concepts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642416,
    "dDurationMs": 6692,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The concept of obedience, the concept of disobedience, and the concept of righteousness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1649108,
    "dDurationMs": 5669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and may I add righteousness taught by Allah Himself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1654777,
    "dDurationMs": 5754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than man-made definitions like the needs of the garden, just man-made."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663560,
    "dDurationMs": 1659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665219,
    "dDurationMs": 2725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when (unintelligible) let us go (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1668882,
    "dDurationMs": 2981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Remember these 3 concepts, alright,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671863,
    "dDurationMs": 4346,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "obedience, disobedience, and righteousness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676934,
    "dDurationMs": 7119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You recall a few weeks ago, there was a discussion in one of our Quranic sessions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1684053,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was going to say, session, but it came out as section."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690000,
    "dDurationMs": 2938,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It had to do with Sura 95."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695369,
    "dDurationMs": 2938,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ustaz's translation, it is this Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698307,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(95:1) وَٱلتِّينِ وَٱلزَّيْتُونِ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1700307,
    "dDurationMs": 3237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the Tin (تِّينِ), by the Tin (تِّينِ) (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703544,
    "dDurationMs": 2512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:1]  By the fig and the olive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1706568,
    "dDurationMs": 2427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:2]  And Mount Sinai."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1765366,
    "dDurationMs": 2213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: Verse 2, Adam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1769880,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the Jewish Bible says that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1773580,
    "dDurationMs": 3511,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All this refers to Noah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777780,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bible says that a raven was sent, and the raven, I think, disappeared."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782400,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, a dove or pigeon was sent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784240,
    "dDurationMs": 3906,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pigeon came with some leaves, olive leaves. Then, we knew there was life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1789500,
    "dDurationMs": 2872,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sinai refers to Mount Sinai, and therefore to Moses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1792372,
    "dDurationMs": 1908,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the Holy Land, referring to Mecca,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1794280,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "refers to Abraham, and therefore Muhammad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798460,
    "dDurationMs": 3681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as I said before, the Quran does not mention"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1802141,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Adam dressed himself with fig leaves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1805269,
    "dDurationMs": 4851,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Quran does not mention that Noah sent a pigeon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1810120,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which came back with olive branches and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1815207,
    "dDurationMs": 860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1816599,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then on another person, a lot of times aware of this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1820000,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this fellow, Sayyid Qutb, a very good man,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1822360,
    "dDurationMs": 2209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who was killed during Nasser's regime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1824569,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sayyid Qutb says, this, huh, what was discussed here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1829069,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But he does not try to prove it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1832669,
    "dDurationMs": 2297,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was using his religious intuition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1834966,
    "dDurationMs": 6786,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a very good man like this has sound religious intuitions. A good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1841752,
    "dDurationMs": 3608,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a very good man, I don't know why I like him so much,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845360,
    "dDurationMs": 2729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or we sympathize with him, he was killed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1848089,
    "dDurationMs": 3229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Sayyid Qutb was using a kind of (unintelligible),"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1851318,
    "dDurationMs": 2311,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on account of his religious inclination,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1853629,
    "dDurationMs": 2431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and religious intuition, he said the same thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856060,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that this refers to Adam, Noah, and so on, so on, so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1859308,
    "dDurationMs": 3409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we also accepted this, didn't we, more or less."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1862973,
    "dDurationMs": 2683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We accepted it, because it made sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1867661,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, now we raise the question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1871286,
    "dDurationMs": 2494,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Good, the Bible has taught us something about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1874249,
    "dDurationMs": 2847,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can we now recheck it with the Quran?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1879101,
    "dDurationMs": 1099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alhamdu Lillah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881138,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Sura 3,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1883378,
    "dDurationMs": 3102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "verse 33, now listen carefully, huh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1886651,
    "dDurationMs": 4874,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Sura 3, verse 33, look what Allah says, and I quote,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891525,
    "dDurationMs": 3022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[3:33] Allah has chosen Adam, ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894547,
    "dDurationMs": 853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ok?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1896210,
    "dDurationMs": 9227,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[3:33] ... Noah, the family of Abraham, and the family of Amram (as messengers) to all the people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1905720,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You notice that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1906920,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the key."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908827,
    "dDurationMs": 5325,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, that interpretation, which we accepted that evening,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914152,
    "dDurationMs": 4008,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a good one, because it is supported by the Quran itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918160,
    "dDurationMs": 1488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look what the Quran says."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1920288,
    "dDurationMs": 1142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:1]  By the fig ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1921771,
    "dDurationMs": 1616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We say fig, Adam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923904,
    "dDurationMs": 2445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the olive, Noah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1926691,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By Mount Sinai, Moses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1929160,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1929660,
    "dDurationMs": 1531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(95:3) بَلَدِ ٱلْأَمِينِ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1931191,
    "dDurationMs": 1713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Abraham, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1934952,
    "dDurationMs": 2208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We were using our religious inclination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1937160,
    "dDurationMs": 1787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Allah helps us."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1938947,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He tells it to us in the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941160,
    "dDurationMs": 1619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allah has chosen Adam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1942779,
    "dDurationMs": 1208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There, the fig."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1945309,
    "dDurationMs": 915,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Noah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1946224,
    "dDurationMs": 4256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there the, the leaf of the olive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1950736,
    "dDurationMs": 1317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The family of Abraham,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1952053,
    "dDurationMs": 4934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that refers to Ibrahim, Ismail, and Muhammad,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1956987,
    "dDurationMs": 1109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(95:3) بَلَدِ ٱلْأَمِينِ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1958693,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the family of Imran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1960693,
    "dDurationMs": 6256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The family of Imran is the family of Moses, Harun (Aaron), and Christ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1966949,
    "dDurationMs": 4787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because Christ, the mother of Christ belongs to the family of Harun (Aaron)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1972205,
    "dDurationMs": 1445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She belongs to Imran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1973650,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So here, I think we are, we should really be convinced that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1977480,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when Allah says, He will explain it to us,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1980000,
    "dDurationMs": 1864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He has the clue somewhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981864,
    "dDurationMs": 3299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only what's the, for us to love the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1985163,
    "dDurationMs": 5317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the more we love it, the more it opens itself to our understanding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1990736,
    "dDurationMs": 3213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thus, the interpretation of Sayyid Qutb,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1993949,
    "dDurationMs": 2531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the explanation of Ustaz Rashad,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1996480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think they are very good, acceptable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1999779,
    "dDurationMs": 1701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not because they said so,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2001480,
    "dDurationMs": 2725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but because the Quran confirms it. Okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2004992,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, let's go even a bit further. Okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2007992,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2010000,
    "dDurationMs": 1488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That same verse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2011488,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where, that same chapter, 95, alright?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2014821,
    "dDurationMs": 806,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: 95?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2016310,
    "dDurationMs": 597,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2016907,
    "dDurationMs": 976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: 95."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2018907,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After saying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2020177,
    "dDurationMs": 3066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(95:3) وَهَٰذَا ٱلْبَلَدِ ٱلْأَمِينِ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2023243,
    "dDurationMs": 1768,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Quran says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025011,
    "dDurationMs": 853,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025864,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:4]  We created human in the best design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2030267,
    "dDurationMs": 1976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:5]  Then reverted him ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2032243,
    "dDurationMs": 1237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or reduced him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2033480,
    "dDurationMs": 2256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:5]  ... to the lowliest of the lowly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2035736,
    "dDurationMs": 7071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:6]  Except those who believe and work righteousness; they will enjoy a well-deserved recompense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2042807,
    "dDurationMs": 763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alright?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2044968,
    "dDurationMs": 1512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This first line,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2046480,
    "dDurationMs": 3208,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:4]  We created human in the best design."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2051437,
    "dDurationMs": 3299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This, I think, is the robe of perfect obedience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2054736,
    "dDurationMs": 1317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the original robe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2056053,
    "dDurationMs": 3427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how Allah created Adam and Eve,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2059480,
    "dDurationMs": 2019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a state of perfect obedience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2062096,
    "dDurationMs": 3616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:5]  Then reverted him to the lowliest of the lowly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2066053,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is what happens when people disobey Allah,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2070053,
    "dDurationMs": 3938,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the robe of disobedience is taken away from him. No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2073991,
    "dDurationMs": 2683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the robe of obedience is taken away from him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2076674,
    "dDurationMs": 1806,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he becomes disobedient,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2078480,
    "dDurationMs": 2995,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "man becomes the lowliest of the lowly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2083480,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:6]  Except those who believe and work righteousness; ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2086480,
    "dDurationMs": 1445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The word here is not Taqwa (تقوا)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2087925,
    "dDurationMs": 3194,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is Salihat (صَّٰلِحَٰتِ), I mean, good works and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2091119,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2092119,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who are those who believe and work righteousness?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2095119,
    "dDurationMs": 4361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the people who wear the robe of righteousness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2099480,
    "dDurationMs": 2232,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this magnificent and splendid robe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2102181,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They will deserve Paradise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2104181,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[95:6]  ... they will enjoy a well-deserved recompense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2107480,
    "dDurationMs": 3213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a robe that will make them deserve Paradise,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2110693,
    "dDurationMs": 1787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it's a perfect robe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2112480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and taught by Allah Himself for us to wear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2116480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2117480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can now see,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2118480,
    "dDurationMs": 1307,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my brothers and sisters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2119787,
    "dDurationMs": 1394,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Sura 95,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2121181,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which begins with Adam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2124181,
    "dDurationMs": 1896,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(95:1) وَٱلتِّينِ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2126077,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Adam ends up with what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2128840,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the children of Adam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2131480,
    "dDurationMs": 1938,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually, in the Quran, we see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2133418,
    "dDurationMs": 2237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we have taught the children of Adam"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2135655,
    "dDurationMs": 3228,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how to wear the robe of righteousness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2140000,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "أعوذ بِٱللَّهِ مِنَ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ٱلرَّجِيمِ\n(I seek refuge in God from Satan the rejected)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2141934,
    "dDurationMs": 1712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bism Allah Arrahman Arraheem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2144951,
    "dDurationMs": 6034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "اللهم اغفر لِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ والمؤمنات والمسلمين والمسلمات الاحياء منهم والاموات"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2150985,
    "dDurationMs": 5285,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(2:201) رَبَّنَآ ءَاتِنَا فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا حَسَنَةً وَفِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ حَسَنَةً وَقِنَا عَذَابَ ٱلنَّارِ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2156825,
    "dDurationMs": 3175,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2161096,
    "dDurationMs": 3683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Allahu Akbar. Allahu Akbar. Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah. Hayya Alal Salat. Hayya Alal Falah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2164779,
    "dDurationMs": 7445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Audience: (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2172224,
    "dDurationMs": 4986,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: Allah had given them, they still, you know,..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2177210,
    "dDurationMs": 1578,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2178788,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: It would not be a shame, (unintelligible) the shame itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2181832,
    "dDurationMs": 8740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will be a shame for everything that Allah had done for them, and still they disobey. They're a shame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2191340,
    "dDurationMs": 5967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a concept of intellectual, moral, spiritual, and the physical aspect is there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2197307,
    "dDurationMs": 2384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's because part of righteousness (unintelligible), right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2200000,
    "dDurationMs": 1616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: But to me it's only a (unintelligible)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2202128,
    "dDurationMs": 6265,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: You know, like in, in Protestant Christianity, that's the most imprecise thing (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2208393,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: Especially after (unintelligible) the coming of Freud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2211374,
    "dDurationMs": 678,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2212351,
    "dDurationMs": 10360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: The enemies of the, of Christianity started to imagine everything. So, they called it forbidden fruit, the seeded banana, you know. You hear that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2222711,
    "dDurationMs": 1275,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Well, the banana."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2224498,
    "dDurationMs": 7378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: Seeded, seeded banana, banana with seeds, that won't be a fruit. So, (unintelligible) a job already."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2231876,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2236940,
    "dDurationMs": 12548,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: That (unintelligible) of (unintelligible) when (unintelligible)\nDean Majul: Just (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2249488,
    "dDurationMs": 4212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: That's what (unintelligible)\nDean Majul: Yeah. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2253999,
    "dDurationMs": 5285,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: That's my proof for that, because it follows the sentence, it says, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2259284,
    "dDurationMs": 636,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(7:26) وَ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2259920,
    "dDurationMs": 2249,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the robe of righteousness is better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2263120,
    "dDurationMs": 4084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But people interpreted (unintelligible) God taught them, good clothes, period."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2267204,
    "dDurationMs": 2796,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: He didn't say \"but\", because the word \"but\" can also mean but."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2270185,
    "dDurationMs": 550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2270735,
    "dDurationMs": 1275,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: As if it's something else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2272010,
    "dDurationMs": 5729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, God teaches them, good thing, good garments, and then, but says, however, better than this is (unintelligible)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2277739,
    "dDurationMs": 1317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: No, this is (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2279696,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: And..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2280196,
    "dDurationMs": 5424,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: It means, in other words, God says, I give you A and B."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2285620,
    "dDurationMs": 2072,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: So, it's good and splendid.\nDean Majul: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2288984,
    "dDurationMs": 1481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: I give you A and B."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2291071,
    "dDurationMs": 4323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "B is not a subject to A, but that B is a qualification of, of A."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2295740,
    "dDurationMs": 11439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: I give you splendid garments, and the one of righteousness is better, better than the leaves, not better than the splendid garment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2308336,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Now, even the leaves of Paradise could be symbolic (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2313256,
    "dDurationMs": 2057,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: Yeah, I have, I have, (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2315313,
    "dDurationMs": 7333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: But, let's, I mean, like, it just shows the gross interpretation even in the Biblical (unintelligible)\nDean Majul: It's good that Quran's translation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2322646,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: did not say \"but.\" It just says period."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2325286,
    "dDurationMs": 3374,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: Then, it says, He uses wa (و) as a period.\nA man: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2328660,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2329640,
    "dDurationMs": 6499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: He says garments as a luxury, then He says, the garments of righteousness are better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2337627,
    "dDurationMs": 4493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But He doesn't say, however, the other garment. No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2342376,
    "dDurationMs": 2178,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: What I'm trying to say is that, that second..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2344554,
    "dDurationMs": 1986,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: It's not a choice. No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2346540,
    "dDurationMs": 5596,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: Here, nor is one substitute for the other one. But one sentence is a continuation of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2352136,
    "dDurationMs": 635,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2352771,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2353980,
    "dDurationMs": 6879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like saying, I will give you, he is good and intelligent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2362700,
    "dDurationMs": 4188,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He can be both good and intelligent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2366888,
    "dDurationMs": 2687,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not that intelligence is better than the third one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2370000,
    "dDurationMs": 10000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: Now, I know that the translations are, are influenced by, like that Biblical story that teaches them his clothes.\nA man: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2380880,
    "dDurationMs": 1177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dean Majul: You mentioned the, that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2382057,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2382983,
    "dDurationMs": 2981,
    "segs": [ {
