    "dDurationMs": 1459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Well, then they don't believe in God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2758093,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: But they do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2759093,
    "dDurationMs": 787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2759880,
    "dDurationMs": 3474,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: Because I (unintelligible) I used to be a Catholic, Ok,\nDr. Khalifa: No, belief, belief in God..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2763354,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: and I used to, well, I (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2767221,
    "dDurationMs": 1659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2768880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I, I really believed that, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2770880,
    "dDurationMs": 3616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: what I was always told, you know, made me believe God in person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2774496,
    "dDurationMs": 1981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Right, so, you don't believe, you didn't believe in God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2777093,
    "dDurationMs": 1531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: You believed in a false god."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2778624,
    "dDurationMs": 2299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: I believed that there was something else, too. Ok?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2780923,
    "dDurationMs": 2957,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: I believed that there was God.\nDr. Khalifa: No, no, no. You See, in here, believe in God means,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2783880,
    "dDurationMs": 2213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: you believe in the Creator of this universe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2786093,
    "dDurationMs": 2787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if you believe in Jesus or in Buddha as a god,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2788880,
    "dDurationMs": 1299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: you're not believing in God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2790179,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: Well, that's what the... Yeah, well, I mean, now I realize that, but..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2793141,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2793641,
    "dDurationMs": 2512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: That's what the Christians and the Catholics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2796153,
    "dDurationMs": 2727,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: because, I mean, they have the Virgin Mary (unintelligible)\nDr. Khalifa: That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2798880,
    "dDurationMs": 5834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Well, God, God says, He makes them satisfied with their belief. Well, that, that is their choice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2804714,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God will make them satisfied with that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2806648,
    "dDurationMs": 2531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this statement is regardless of anything else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2809179,
    "dDurationMs": 2061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Any person who believes in God,..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2812264,
    "dDurationMs": 2957,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're talking about only one thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2815392,
    "dDurationMs": 1659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is only one God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2817051,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you're either believing in Him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2818880,
    "dDurationMs": 1403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or in other false god."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2821307,
    "dDurationMs": 1786,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You believe in Jesus as God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2823093,
    "dDurationMs": 2214,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you firmly believe in God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2825307,
    "dDurationMs": 1677,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that, you're not believing in God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2827880,
    "dDurationMs": 1824,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are believing in a false god."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2832221,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And believing in God also implies believing in God alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2836221,
    "dDurationMs": 1659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because if you believe in God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2837880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you will not go to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2840880,
    "dDurationMs": 2697,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: minute creatures as gods."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2845880,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: (unintelligible) that you said that you deserve God (unintelligible) I know that (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2850880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Well, then you don't believe in God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2852880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because when you believe in God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2854880,
    "dDurationMs": 3488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know that He is much too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2858368,
    "dDurationMs": 3171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: glorified, much too glorious to have a son."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2861539,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: You will understand, you'll understand,\nA woman: (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2865179,
    "dDurationMs": 2701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Of course, you will understand that God"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2867880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does not need to reproduce Himself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2870880,
    "dDurationMs": 2488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does not need to preserve the species,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2873368,
    "dDurationMs": 4943,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that reproduction and children is a characteristic of immortals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2879245,
    "dDurationMs": 2147,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, when you say a son of God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2881392,
    "dDurationMs": 2104,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you don't believe in God any longer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2884221,
    "dDurationMs": 659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2884880,
    "dDurationMs": 5427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: (unintelligible) Okay, when it says that, those who believe in God, it says, Jewish or Christian, or..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2890307,
    "dDurationMs": 573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2891819,
    "dDurationMs": 4061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: does (unintelligible) so,..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2895880,
    "dDurationMs": 3687,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: They will do it, if they believe in God, they will do it by instinct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2901179,
    "dDurationMs": 4261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: And if they come across it in Quran, they will have no objection to it. They will do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2905880,
    "dDurationMs": 3048,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: But (unintelligible) a Christian is taught, I mean, (unintelligible) today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2909496,
    "dDurationMs": 701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2910197,
    "dDurationMs": 3005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: I mean, do it (unintelligible) they don't (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2913202,
    "dDurationMs": 5337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Yes, they do. Well, well, there are a few individuals who reach the belief in God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2918539,
    "dDurationMs": 3341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they do the Prayers by instinct, they fall prostrate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2921880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer to your question is in Sura 3,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2923880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "verse, I think, it's what, 65."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2926880,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sura 3, let's go to that one, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2930000,
    "dDurationMs": 5136,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the Quran,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2935136,
    "dDurationMs": 3602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have to take the whole,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2938738,
    "dDurationMs": 1142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the whole of the Quran."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2943762,
    "dDurationMs": 3118,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Okay, I'll give you the, the verse number soon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2950506,
    "dDurationMs": 2512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2953018,
    "dDurationMs": 550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Uhum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2953781,
    "dDurationMs": 1616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: (unintelligible)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2958170,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: Page 42."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2964136,
    "dDurationMs": 1469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: A hundred and what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2966543,
    "dDurationMs": 1531,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: Well, page 42."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2968074,
    "dDurationMs": 811,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman: Page 42."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2968885,
    "dDurationMs": 2161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Okay. Righteous Jews \u0026 Christians"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2972965,
    "dDurationMs": 4256,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, now this is the answer to Debbie's question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2977221,
    "dDurationMs": 1659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "113"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2978880,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[3:113]  They are not all alike; among the people of the scripture, ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2982160,
    "dDurationMs": 1427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is Jews and Christians,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2983587,
    "dDurationMs": 7673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[3:113]  ... there are those who are righteous. They recite God's scripture throughout the night, and they fall prostrate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2991260,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2992624,
    "dDurationMs": 2578,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They actually do. I've met people like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2995648,
    "dDurationMs": 3232,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, they are doing this a lot by instinct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2998880,
    "dDurationMs": 2512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, they don't have the complete,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3001392,
    "dDurationMs": 4175,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the correct meal, you know. It's like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3005567,
    "dDurationMs": 1825,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are feeding their soul,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3007392,
    "dDurationMs": 1488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not a complete meal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3008880,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like you feeding your body only starch,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3013880,
    "dDurationMs": 3341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "carbohydrates without the vitamins and so forth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3017520,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You, your, your body will grow and will be sustained, but it will be weak."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3022435,
    "dDurationMs": 3445,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why the next verse is important, 114 says,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3025880,
    "dDurationMs": 7759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[3:114]  They believe in GOD and the Last Day, they advocate righteousness and forbid evil, and they are eager to work righteousness. They are pious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3033639,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, next one is the one I mean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3035639,
    "dDurationMs": 3241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[3:115]  Whatever good they do will never go unrewarded. ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3038880,
    "dDurationMs": 2427,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, they'll be rewarded for what they are doing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3041307,
    "dDurationMs": 5957,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they do not have the complete recipe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3047264,
    "dDurationMs": 1232,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the complete meal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3048496,
    "dDurationMs": 2384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have to come to Islam, they have to do their Prayers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3050880,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our advantage is that we have the whole thing described to us in detail,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3055880,
    "dDurationMs": 2488,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as to how to develop and grow our soul."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3058880,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But a Christian or a Jew or a Buddhist or a Hindu, who comes to the conviction that he believes, or, or she believes in God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3065880,
    "dDurationMs": 2578,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when I say God, you know what I'm talking about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3068458,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not Buddha and not a monkey and not a cow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3071458,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and not Jesus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3073458,
    "dDurationMs": 2422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God, just that one word."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3076307,
    "dDurationMs": 3693,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If that person believes in God, they will do the Prayer instinctively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3080221,
    "dDurationMs": 976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3081538,
    "dDurationMs": 2579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They bow, they prostrate, they make Ruku' and Sujood,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3084117,
    "dDurationMs": 3431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they commemorate, they meditate on God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3087548,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they ask, they glorify God,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3089548,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they ask God for forgiveness, they repent when they make a mistake,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3092468,
    "dDurationMs": 1981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they are beautiful, and they're go to Heaven."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3099283,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is, this is all that is required."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3104581,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why being hung up on a prophet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3108581,
    "dDurationMs": 1787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or a certain person is wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3110368,
    "dDurationMs": 3365,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All the prophets want us to forget them and worship God alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3117880,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ya Mansur, the brother who was sitting where Inga was, with a beard,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3121880,
    "dDurationMs": 2454,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's in Phoenix, he lives in Phoenix, he called me yesterday,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3124334,
    "dDurationMs": 2546,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he's writing something, and he said that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3126880,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "talking about the requirements,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3128880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he said, one is Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah, the first one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3131880,
    "dDurationMs": 3115,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you declare \"Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah Wa Ash-hadu Anna Muhammadan Rasool Allah.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3135444,
    "dDurationMs": 2551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I said, no, just Ash-hadu Alla Elaha Ella Allah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3139380,
    "dDurationMs": 3357,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because how about Noah? Why don't you say, Ash-hadu Anna Noah Rasool Allah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3143444,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3145171,
    "dDurationMs": 2582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: Well, how about Lot, Saleh, and Hud?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3147753,
    "dDurationMs": 1127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A man: Ibrahim."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3148880,
    "dDurationMs": 5556,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dr. Khalifa: How about Ibrahim, or Jesus, or Moses? I mean, why? The Quran tells us twice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3154436,
    "dDurationMs": 2444,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we should not make distinction among the prophets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3156880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, but,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3157880,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what is required of anybody is to declare that there is no god except God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3163880,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, this is a very important doctrine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3169541,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it shows the tolerance of, of, this is the truth, I mean."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3173674,
    "dDurationMs": 2061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God is the most tolerant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3177589,
    "dDurationMs": 4345,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what is, what is required is some people don't even have a religion, they come to the conviction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3181934,
    "dDurationMs": 3285,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this universe is created by a Creator,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3185219,
    "dDurationMs": 2018,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who must be worshipped, and then God takes over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3187237,
    "dDurationMs": 1643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once the person makes a decision,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3188880,
    "dDurationMs": 1982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "God teaches them to do the Salat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3192219,
    "dDurationMs": 2273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they may even do more than we do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3194492,
    "dDurationMs": 3181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more than the five Prayers. See, the five Prayers are the minimum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3200365,
    "dDurationMs": 3115,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whenever you feel like it, you should get up and do some prayer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3203880,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But don't be pushed too much, either."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3207268,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But because of the, the hunger of their soul,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3210268,
    "dDurationMs": 1903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and because they reach the Truth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3212171,
    "dDurationMs": 4709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they may do a lot more glorifying of God, asking forgiveness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3216880,
    "dDurationMs": 1128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3218589,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't believe that Jesus is son of God, or God, or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3221122,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't believe that Mary has any power,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3224655,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they don't believe that the cow is sacred,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3227655,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "etc., etc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3228655,
    "dDurationMs": 1225,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They believe in God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3229880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3230880,
    "dDurationMs": 1564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna read the verse again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3232444,
    "dDurationMs": 1436,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "verse 62."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3234380,
    "dDurationMs": 1758,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[2:62] ... those who believe, ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3236138,
    "dDurationMs": 1742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like us, believe in this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3238380,
    "dDurationMs": 15087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[2:62] ... those who are Jewish, the Christians, and the converts; any of them who (1) believes in GOD, and (2) the Last Day, and (3) leads a righteous life, shall receive their recompense from their Lord. And they have nothing to fear, nor will they grieve."
